<title>BELGIUM: European Commission rejects Clabecq plan - radio.</title>
<headline>European Commission rejects Clabecq plan - radio.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission has rejected a rescue plan for Belgian steel firm Forges de Clabecq , Belgian radio BRTN said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It gave no details.</p>
</text>
